0895802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Render High-Quality Simulations</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galaxy Engine allows you to export videos and frames of simulations with millions of particles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/589d5792616975ab55d6e59d6c564164.poster.avif?t=1750895802\" width=764 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/589d5792616975ab55d6e59d6c564164.webm?t=1750895802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/589d5792616975ab55d6e59d6c564164.mp4?t=1750895802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Result:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/421e4959fe5aeacaf9d5e48ad7459398.poster.avif?t=1750895802\" width=764 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/421e4959fe5aeacaf9d5e48ad7459398.webm?t=1750895802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/421e4959fe5aeacaf9d5e48ad7459398.mp4?t=1750895802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
